  markup that the flattened design pages carry — scripts/unify-header.js copies
  it from public/ad-on-digital/index.html, and this partial is generated from
  that same source. The site was assembled from three design exports, each of
  which shipped its own header, so clicking into a division used to swap the
  logo and the menu for that division's. There is one header now.

